@startuml
title Customer Activity Analytics — Analysis and history use cases
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor<<MANDATORY>> #FFB3B3
  BackgroundColor<<MUST_HAVE>> #FFD699
  BackgroundColor<<NICE_TO_HAVE>> #D6EAF8
}

actor "Customer Care\nOperator" as Operator
actor "Customer\n<<business stakeholder>>" as Customer

rectangle "Customer Activity Analytics\n<<system boundary>>" as SystemBoundary {
  package "AI-assisted customer analysis" {
    usecase "Request AI Analysis\n[FR-AI-001]" as UC_Request <<MANDATORY>>
    usecase "Build Customer Analysis Context" as UC_Context <<MANDATORY>>
    usecase "Retrieve Relevant Policy Knowledge\n[FR-RAG-001]" as UC_RAG <<MUST_HAVE>>
    usecase "Produce Structured Risk Analysis\n[FR-AI-002]" as UC_Result <<MANDATORY>>
    usecase "Persist Completed Analysis\n[FR-HIST-001]" as UC_Persist <<MUST_HAVE>>
  }

  package "Analysis history review" {
    usecase "Review Previous Analyses\n[FR-HIST-002]" as UC_History <<MUST_HAVE>>
    usecase "List Prior Analyses" as UC_List <<MUST_HAVE>>
    usecase "Inspect Prior Analysis" as UC_Inspect <<MUST_HAVE>>
  }

  UC_Request .> UC_Context : <<include>>
  UC_Request .> UC_RAG : <<include>>
  UC_Result .> UC_Request : <<extend>>\n[valid structured result produced]
  UC_Persist .> UC_Result : <<extend>>\n[valid completed result]
  UC_History .> UC_List : <<include>>
  UC_Inspect .> UC_History : <<extend>>\n[analysis selected]
}

Operator -- UC_Request
Operator -- UC_History
Customer ..> UC_Request : <<business subject>>
Customer ..> UC_History : <<business subject>>

note right of UC_Result
  Successful result contract:
  risk level + non-empty findings summary + recommendations.
  This view does not state whether an explicitly ungrounded mode may produce
  such a result; AMB-RAG-001 remains unresolved.
end note

note bottom of UC_Request
  Protected capability. Context construction and policy retrieval are attempted.
  No use-case relation here resolves AMB-RAG-001 beyond accepted SRS semantics.
end note

note right of Customer
  Customer is the subject whose activity is analyzed and retained.
  The source does not specify direct customer access to the operator application.
end note

legend bottom
  |= Notation |= Meaning |
  | Solid actor association | Direct system interaction |
  | Dashed <<business subject>> dependency | Business stakeholder/context only; not UI interaction |
  | <<include>> | Mandatory reused behaviour |
  | <<extend>> | Conditional behaviour inserted under the stated guard |
  | Package | Logical grouping inside the system boundary |
  |= Colour |= Delivery priority |
  |<#FFB3B3> | MANDATORY |
  |<#FFD699> | MUST_HAVE |
  |<#D6EAF8> | NICE_TO_HAVE |
endlegend
@enduml
